stave 1

/// A glued face joint: two parts glued face to face, with nothing cut: a
/// cleat glued inside an apron, a lining, a leg doubled up from two boards.
/// It holds the parts together, so neither is loose.
kind glued_face : joint {
  // Nothing is pushed in: the parts are laid together and clamped.

  note: "Spread glue thinly on both faces, then clamp them together with even pressure until the glue sets"
}
